    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="&xsd;string">Unit of measure ontology for PLM RDL. Includes cross-references to other sources of interest. Disclaimer: This ontology is based on an earlier, unspecified version of IDO. Since parts of IDO have been removed in later releases, this ontology may include references that are not valid in the latest IDO version. It is published here to give users a starting point and inspiration for how IDO can be applied. Your feedback will help us develop updated ontologies aligned with the latest IDO version.</rdfs:comment>
